Description: Update chrome_browser_browser.patch for Debian Chromium 147
 Adjusts line numbers and git index hashes to match Debian's patched Chromium
 source. Debian applies additional patches that shift line numbers compared to
 vanilla Chromium. Also removes hunks for GetCurrentPageIcon (PictureInPicture),
 UpdatePreferredSize, and ResizeDueToAutoResize that conflict with Debian
 Chromium changes. This patch ensures the CEF browser integration patch applies
 cleanly to Debian Chromium.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-04-10

